<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">data {
&nbsp;&nbsp;int&lt;lower=1&gt; N;                  // subjects
&nbsp;&nbsp;int&lt;lower=2&gt; K;                  // states
&nbsp;&nbsp;matrix[K,K] A[N];                // FO-asymmetry per subject (diagonal unused)
