<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">What It Explains</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Behavior: Reaction times and memory replay depend on which phase of the cycle the brain is in. Certain phases favor faster responses, others favor recall.</p>
