<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Clinical applications: Disorders like REM sleep behavior disorder, ADHD, or Alzheimerâ€™s could be seen as failures of synchrony between cycles and chains â€” either too rigid, too noisy, or desynchronized at the wrong times.</p>
