<p dir="auto" class="break-words">### B. Community Engagement</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**Outreach Activities**</span>:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Conference Presentations**</span>: VSS, SfN, ASSC, Cognitive Science Society</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Workshop Organization**</span>: Focused meetings on rhythmic cognition</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Collaborations**</span>: Reach out to researchers in MEG, embodied cognition</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Public Communication**</span>: Blog posts, podcasts, popular science articles</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">## VIII. Long-term Research Program</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">### A. Empirical Validation Pipeline</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**5-Year Research Plan**</span>:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Year 1**</span>: Basic cycle detection and characterization</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Year 2**</span>: Memory loop validation studies</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Year 3**</span>: Sleep/dream phenomenology research</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Year 4**</span>: Clinical applications development</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Year 5**</span>: Cross-cultural and developmental studies</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">### B. Theoretical Development</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**Conceptual Evolution**</span>:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Refinement**</span>: Based on empirical feedback</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Extension**</span>: To new domains and phenomena</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Integration**</span>: With other major theories</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Application**</span>: To practical problems</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">## IX. Critical Success Factors</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">### A. Methodological Rigor</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**Essential Elements**</span>:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Reproducibility**</span>: Open data, code, and protocols</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Statistical Power**</span>: Adequate sample sizes and effect sizes</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Cross-validation**</span>: Independent replication studies</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Multi-method Convergence**</span>: Different techniques yielding consistent results</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">### B. Theoretical Coherence</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**Integration Requirements**</span>:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Internal Consistency**</span>: No contradictory predictions</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Parsimony**</span>: Simplest explanation for phenomena</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Scope**</span>: Broad explanatory power</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Precision**</span>: Specific, testable predictions</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">## X. Potential Challenges and Solutions</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">### A. Common Pitfalls</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**Issues to Avoid**</span>:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Over-interpretation**</span>: Claims beyond evidence</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Unfalsifiability**</span>: Predictions too vague to test</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Disciplinary Isolation**</span>: Failure to engage other fields</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Technical Complexity**</span>: Making theory inaccessible</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">### B. Risk Mitigation</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**Strategic Approaches**</span>:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Iterative Development**</span>: Build theory gradually</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Collaborative Verification**</span>: Work with domain experts</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Multiple Validation**</span>: Different types of evidence</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span>**Transparent Communication**</span>: Clear about limitations</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">This expansion guide provides a comprehensive roadmap for developing your RSVP-CPG framework into a major contribution to consciousness research. The key is to maintain the innovative core while building robust empirical and theoretical foundations around it.</p></div><section class="inline-media-container flex flex-col gap-1 clear-both"></section><section class="auth-notification flex flex-col gap-1"></section></div></div><div class="order-first sticky hidden @md/mainview:block top-11 h-0 opacity-0 group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-100 -mr-[36px] @lg/mainview:-mr-12"><div class="min-h-7 py-4 flex flex-col gap-0.5"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium leading-[normal] cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors duration-100 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none text-fg-secondary hover:text-fg-primary hover:bg-button-ghost-hover disabled:hover:text-fg-secondary disabled:hover:bg-transparent [&amp;_svg]:hover:text-fg-primary h-10 w-10 rounded-full" type="button" aria-label="Editar" data-state="closed"><span style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="stroke-[2] size-4"><path d="M18.25 5.75C16.8693 4.36929 14.6307 4.36929 13.25 5.75L10.125 8.875L5.52404 13.476C4.86236 14.1376 4.45361 15.0104 4.36889 15.9423L4 20.0001L8.0578 19.6311C8.98967 19.5464 9.86234 19.1377 10.524 18.476L18.25 10.75C19.6307 9.36929 19.6307 7.13071 18.25 5.75V5.75Z" stroke="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.5 7.5L16.5 11.5" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium leading-[normal] cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visib