<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">auto-autoregression implies a higher-order objective:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Î˜</mi><mo>âˆ—</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>â¡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>â¡</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Î˜</mi></munder><mi mathvariant="double-struck">E</mi><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">[</mo><mo>âˆ’</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>â¡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Î˜</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Î¸</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>âˆ£</mo><msub><mi>Î¸</mi><mrow><mo>â‰¤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">]</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Theta^\ast = \arg\min_\Theta \mathbb{E} \big[ -\log p_\Theta(\theta_t \mid \theta_{\le t}) \big],</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7387em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Î˜</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.7387em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mbin mtight">âˆ—</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.5943em; vertical-align: -0.7443em;"></span><span class="mop">ar<span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6679em;">